{"product_id":"jaguar-trials","title":"Jaguar Trials","description":"\u003cp\u003eThirteen-year-old Ben finds himself in Central America with his parents - and stumbling into an ancient mystery. Along with two local kids, he is determined to solve the ancient trials of El Dorado, lift the curse and find the gold. But along the way Ben learns important things about friendship - and realizes that treasure might not be all there is to find at the end of the trials. Another rip-roaring action adventure from author Ruth Eastham, blending clues, magic and mystery.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 136 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ruth Eastham\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781407155043\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 225\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45788109963417,"sku":"2RC9781407155043","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ec90859bbfe_Jaguar_Trials_Ruth_Eastham.jpg?v=1760369230","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/jaguar-trials","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}